ebp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d982d77b523ae191f4ceb048cc4a8b0f 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI would like to ask if you could draw the character in the URL.\nThe illustration was drawn by Kanju (@poyo029), and I have permission to use it as a reference material.\n\nThe character is cheerful and cheerful personality.\nShe has a cheerful personality.\nShe is about 160cm tall.\nShe is skilled with a sword and a bow.\n\nPurpose of use\nPlease note that the illustration may be used for the following purposes.\nWallpaper for PCs and smartphones (the size is up to you).\nHeaders and icons for SNS such as Note and X (Twitter).\nReference material for future requests for illustrations, novels, cartoons, and music.\nIllustrations will be posted on SNS such as \"note\" and \"X (Twitter)\".\n\nOther\nWe are willing to rearrange the design.\nPlease use color illustrations.\nPlease use color illustrations.\nPlease refrain from excessive exposure.\nPlease do not emphasize the breasts too much.\n\nPlease do not emphasize the breasts too much.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/OZTs5S2ygYzicXl/status/1415267415324196865", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mink_171219/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2103662, "client_id": 2655364, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d32908d9/uploads/origins/1a62ac26-781a-47a7-bf4b-0f7707f13493?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb63defb75b68e0802f0ab96da71a6b6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d32908d9/uploads/origins/1a62ac26-781a-47a7-bf4b-0f7707f13493?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb63defb75b68e0802f0ab96da71a6b6, https://si.imgix.net/d32908d9/uploads/origins/1a62ac26-781a-47a7-bf4b-0f7707f13493?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6